<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="1. ‣ 3.2 Designing the Likelihood, Prior, and Posterior Terms ‣ 3 InPose: Inverse Zero-Shot Pose Estimation ‣ Zero-shot Human Pose Estimation using Diffusion-based Inverse solvers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">See <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="1. ‣ 3.2 Designing the Likelihood, Prior, and Posterior Terms ‣ 3 InPose: Inverse Zero-Shot Pose Estimation ‣ Zero-shot Human Pose Estimation using Diffusion-based Inverse solvers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">(Sketch)We will prove the validity of the Gaussian approximation for a single joint rotation <math id="A1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{t}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{t}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>.
This result can then be naturally extended to <math id="A1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{t}_{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{t}_{M}</annotation></semantics></math> because each joint rotation is independent in the global reference frame.
From <math id="A1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pi</annotation></semantics></math>GDM, we approximate <math id="A1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}(r^{T}_{M}|r^{t}_{M})\approx\mathcal{N}(\hat{r}^{t}_{M},w_{t}^{2}\text{I})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>I</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}(r^{T}_{M}|r^{t}_{M})\approx\mathcal{N}(\hat{r}^{t}_{M},w_{t}^{2}\text{I})</annotation></semantics></math>.
This implies that every element <math id="A1.p2.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="r^{0,k}_{j},\;\forall k\in\{1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6\},\;\forall j\in M\sim\mathcal{N}(\hat{r}^{t,k}_{j},w_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{0,k}_{j},\;\forall k\in\{1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6\},\;\forall j\in M\sim\mathcal{N}(\hat{r}^{t,k}_{j},w_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> are i.i.d. Gaussian Random variables.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">The mapping <math id="A1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathcal{D}}(r^{0}_{j})=R^{0}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathcal{D}}(r^{0}_{j})=R^{0}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined as:</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle c^{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle c^{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex2.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\begin{bmatrix}r^{1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3}_{j}(t)\end{bmatrix}^{\top}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>r</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\begin{bmatrix}r^{1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3}_{j}(t)\end{bmatrix}^{\top},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{c}^{1}=\frac{c^{1}}{||c^{1}||}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{c}^{1}=\frac{c^{1}}{||c^{1}||}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex3"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle c^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle c^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\begin{bmatrix}r^{4\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}(t)\end{bmatrix}^{\top}-~\text{proj}_{\bar{c}^{1}}\Big(\begin{bmatrix}r^{4\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}(t)\end{bmatrix}^{\top}\Big),\qquad" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>r</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo rspace="0.552em">−</mo><msub><mtext>proj</mtext><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msup></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>r</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\begin{bmatrix}r^{4\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}(t)\end{bmatrix}^{\top}-~\text{proj}_{\bar{c}^{1}}\Big(\begin{bmatrix}r^{4\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}(t)\end{bmatrix}^{\top}\Big),\qquad</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{c}^{2}=\frac{c^{2}}{||c^{2}||}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{c}^{2}=\frac{c^{2}}{||c^{2}||}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex4"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{c}^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{c}^{3}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{c}^{1}\times\bar{c}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{c}^{1}\times\bar{c}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright" colspan="3"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle R_{j}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle R_{j}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\begin{bmatrix}\bar{c}^{1}&amp;\bar{c}^{2}&amp;\bar{c}^{3}\end{bmatrix}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt"><mtr><mtd><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\begin{bmatrix}\bar{c}^{1}&amp;\bar{c}^{2}&amp;\bar{c}^{3}\end{bmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright" colspan="3"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">By the definition of <math id="A1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathcal{D}}(r^{0}_{j})=R^{0}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathcal{D}}(r^{0}_{j})=R^{0}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>, the unit norm constraints <math id="A1.p5.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="||\hat{r}^{t,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3}_{j}||=||\hat{r}^{t,3\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}||=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">=</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0.167em">=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">||\hat{r}^{t,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3}_{j}||=||\hat{r}^{t,3\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}||=1</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.p5.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\langle\hat{r}^{t,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3}_{j},\hat{r}^{t,3\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}\rangle=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle\hat{r}^{t,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3}_{j},\hat{r}^{t,3\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}\rangle=0</annotation></semantics></math>, the elements of the first two columns, <math id="A1.p5.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="R^{0,(1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}2,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3)}_{j}\sim\mathcal{N}(\hat{R}^{t,(l,m)}_{j},w_{t}^{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{0,(1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}2,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3)}_{j}\sim\mathcal{N}(\hat{R}^{t,(l,m)}_{j},w_{t}^{2})</annotation></semantics></math> are also Gaussian random variables that are uncorrelated.
Now, the elements of the third column of each <math id="A1.p5.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="R^{0,(3,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3)}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{0,(3,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3)}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> are the result of the cross-product <math id="A1.p5.m6" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="r^{0,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3}_{j}\times r^{0,3\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{0,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3}_{j}\times r^{0,3\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}6}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Let’s first discuss <math id="A1.p5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{0,(3,2)}_{j}=(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{0,(3,2)}_{j}=(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})</annotation></semantics></math>. The mean of this random variable is:</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}]-\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}]-\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}]\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,4}]-\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,1}]\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,6}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}]\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,4}]-\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,1}]\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,6}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j}-\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j}-\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, all the elements of the third column <math id="A1.p7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="R^{0,(3,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3)}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{0,(3,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3)}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> have their mean given by the respective cross-product terms. Next, we can compute the variance as:</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Var}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Var</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Var}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})^{2}]-\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})^{2}]-\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">Treating the terms separately, we get</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝔼</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4})^{2}]+\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})^{2}]-2\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4})^{2}]+\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})^{2}]-2\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3})^{2}]\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,4})^{2}]+\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,1})^{2}]\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,6})^{2}]-2\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3})^{2}]\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,4})^{2}]+\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,1})^{2}]\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,6})^{2}]-2\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(w_{t}^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j})^{2})(w_{t}^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2})+(w_{t}^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j})^{2})(w_{t}^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2})-2\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(w_{t}^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j})^{2})(w_{t}^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2})+(w_{t}^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j})^{2})(w_{t}^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2})-2\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=2w_{t}^{4}+w_{t}^{2}((\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j})^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2})+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j})^{2})+(\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2}))+(\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2}-2\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=2w_{t}^{4}+w_{t}^{2}((\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j})^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2})+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j})^{2})+(\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2}))+(\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2}-2\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text">using the independence property and the definition of variance. Next,</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}]^{2}+\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]^{2}-2\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}]^{2}+\mathbb{E}[r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]^{2}-2\mathbb{E}[(r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2}-2\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2}-2\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j}\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p13.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p13.1.1" class="ltx_text">Substituting the above terms into Eqn. <a href="#A1.E15" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem ‣ Zero-shot Human Pose Estimation using Diffusion-based Inverse solvers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>, we get</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{Var}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]=w_{t}^{2}(2w_{t}^{2}+((\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j})^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2})+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j})^{2})+(\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>Var</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{Var}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6}]=w_{t}^{2}(2w_{t}^{2}+((\hat{r}^{t,3}_{j})^{2}+(\hat{r}^{t,4}_{j})^{2})+(\hat{r}^{t,1}_{j})^{2})+(\hat{r}^{t,6}_{j})^{2}))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p15.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p15.1.1" class="ltx_text">Finally, we compute each of the covariances of the third column elements <math id="A1.p15.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="R^{0,(3,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3)}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{0,(3,1\mathrel{\mathop{\ordinarycolon}}3)}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>.
To compute <math id="A1.p15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Cov}[R^{0,(3,2)}_{j},r^{0,1}_{j}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Cov}[R^{0,(3,2)}_{j},r^{0,1}_{j}]</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p16" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><span id="A1.Ex6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">Cov</span></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6},r^{0,1}_{j}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4}-r_{j}^{0,1}r_{j}^{0,6},r^{0,1}_{j}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\text{Cov}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4},r^{0,1}_{j}]-\text{Cov}[(r_{j}^{0,1})^{2}r_{j}^{0,6}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\text{Cov}[r_{j}^{0,3}r_{j}^{0,4},r^{0,1}_{j}]-\text{Cov}[(r_{j}^{0,1})^{2}r_{j}^{0,6}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
